{"title":"Aug 1 — East Jeju","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 1 — East Jeju"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Saturday · August 1, 2026 · Day 7 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">East Jeju 🌅</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Seongsan · Haenyeo Show · Gwangchigi Beach · Umu & Gamttanam · Jeju</div>\n  <div class=\"pending-badge\">🔧 Needs Fixes</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug01\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug01').setView([33.4600, 126.9000], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Shilla Stay Jeju Airport', lat:33.48580289503151, lng:126.49091012883574, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Jeju+Airport' },\n    { name:'Seongsan Ilchulbong (Sunrise Peak) 🌅', lat:33.4583, lng:126.9422, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seongsan+Ilchulbong+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Haenyeo Diver Show 🤿', lat:33.464604859978465, lng:126.93627516215088, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rnbz4s2sdFUvYDZG6' },\n    { name:'Nolaba Ramen 🍜', lat:33.48284914231799, lng:126.37621955092507, c:'#43A047', url:'https://maps.app.goo.gl/USjTj739GHcDPqaZ9' },\n    { name:'Gwangchigi Beach 🏖️', lat:33.4650, lng:126.9200, c:'#1976D2', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gwangchigi+Beach+Jeju' },\n    { name:'Umu Cafe ☕', lat:33.4059540478567, lng:126.25654873629324, c:'#AB47BC', url:'https://maps.app.goo.gl/9rWsErEPUwd7wSPu9' },\n    { name:'Gamttanam (Orange Cafe) 🍊', lat:33.26235649570158, lng:126.49473094088607, c:'#FFA726', url:'https://maps.app.goo.gl/gwT68uXbakAW2xT88' },\n    { name:'Jung Jong Jeju Black Pork BBQ 🐷', lat:33.49112408965034, lng:126.50181770217206, c:'#C62828', url:'https://maps.app.goo.gl/Wo5RRJGezrjXzfdP9' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Early Morning — Sunrise Hike</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T04:00\" data-lat=\"33.48580289503151\" data-lng=\"126.49091012883574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">04:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">⏰ Wake Up</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Wake Up & Depart Shilla Stay Jeju Airport</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">🚗 <strong>~55 min drive</strong> to Seongsan Ilchulbong. Depart by <strong>04:10</strong> to arrive at 05:10–05:20 — leaving enough time to park, buy tickets, and hike up before sunrise.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T05:15\" data-lat=\"33.4583\" data-lng=\"126.9422\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">05:15</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌅 Sunrise</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Hike Seongsan Ilchulbong (Sunrise Peak)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">UNESCO World Heritage volcanic crater rising from the sea. The sunrise from the summit is one of Korea's most iconic sights.<br><br>\n      <strong>🕔 Timeline:</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>05:10–05:20</strong> — Arrive, park, buy tickets (₩2,000)</li>\n        <li><strong>05:20–05:40</strong> — Hike up (20–30 min, can be steep)</li>\n        <li><strong>05:40–06:00</strong> — Sunrise at the summit 🌅</li>\n      </ul>\n      Gate opens at 05:00 in summer. Bring a jacket — windy at the top. Headlamp helpful in pre-dawn dark.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seongsan+Ilchulbong+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Seongsan Peak</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/성산일출봉\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Midday</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T12:00\" data-lat=\"33.48284914231799\" data-lng=\"126.37621955092507\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">12:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍜 Lunch</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Nolaba Ramen</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Popular ramen spot near the Seongsan area. Great post-hike warm-up meal.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/USjTj739GHcDPqaZ9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/놀아바+라멘+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card activity\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T13:30\" data-lat=\"33.464604859978465\" data-lng=\"126.93627516215088\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🤿 Show</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Haenyeo Diver Show</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Watch Jeju's legendary female free-divers (해녀) demonstrate their tradition of diving without equipment to harvest abalone, sea urchin, and seaweed. A living piece of UNESCO Intangible Heritage.<br><br>\n      🕑 <strong>Show starts at 2:00 PM daily — closed Mondays.</strong><br>\n      ⚠️ Arrive early to secure a good viewing spot as it fills up quickly.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rnbz4s2sdFUvYDZG6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해녀공연+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Beach & Cafe</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T15:00\" data-lat=\"33.4650\" data-lng=\"126.9200\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">15:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🏖️ Beach</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Gwangchigi Beach</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Scenic east-coast beach with black lava rocks and Seongsan Ilchulbong as a backdrop. Great for swimming or just relaxing.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gwangchigi+Beach+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gwangchigi Beach</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/광치기해변\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T16:30\" data-lat=\"33.4059540478567\" data-lng=\"126.25654873629324\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">☕ Cafe</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Umu Cafe</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Scenic cafe near Seongsan with ocean views. Great for afternoon coffee and views back to the volcanic peak.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/9rWsErEPUwd7wSPu9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Umu</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/우무+카페+성산\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T17:00\" data-lat=\"33.26235649570158\" data-lng=\"126.49473094088607\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">17:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍊 Cafe</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Gamttanam — Orange Cafe</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Famous orange/tangerine themed cafe in Jeju. The island is famous for hallabong citrus, and this cafe uses them in drinks and desserts.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/gwT68uXbakAW2xT88\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/감태나무+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T19:30\" data-lat=\"33.49112408965034\" data-lng=\"126.50181770217206\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🐷 Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Jung Jong Jeju Black Pork BBQ (흑돼지)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Jeju's signature dish — black Berkshire pigs raised on the island, with distinctly richer flavour. Best enjoyed as thick slices of pork belly (samgyeopsal) grilled over charcoal.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Wo5RRJGezrjXzfdP9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/중정제주흑돼지\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Set alarm for 04:00</strong> — depart by 04:10 for the ~55 min drive to Seongsan. Aim to arrive 05:10–05:20, hike up in 20–30 min, and catch sunrise at 05:40–06:00. Cafes and restaurants near Seongsan open from ~08:00.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Saturday · August 1, 2026 · Day 7 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">East Jeju 🌅</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Seongsan · Haenyeo Show · Gwangchigi Beach · Umu & Gamttanam · Jeju</div>\n  <div class=\"pending-badge\">🔧 Needs Fixes</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug01\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug01').setView([33.4600, 126.9000], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Shilla Stay Jeju Airport', lat:33.48580289503151, lng:126