r ramen spot near the Seongsan area. Great post-hike warm-up meal.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/USjTj739GHcDPqaZ9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/놀아바+라멘+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card activity\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T13:30\" data-lat=\"33.464604859978465\" data-lng=\"126.93627516215088\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🤿 Show</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Haenyeo Diver Show</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Watch Jeju's legendary female free-divers (해녀) demonstrate their tradition of diving without equipment to harvest abalone, sea urchin, and seaweed. A living piece of UNESCO Intangible Heritage.<br><br>\n      🕑 <strong>Show starts at 2:00 PM daily — closed Mondays.</strong><br>\n      ⚠️ Arrive early to secure a good viewing spot as it fills up quickly.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rnbz4s2sdFUvYDZG6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해녀공연+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Beach & Cafe</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T15:00\" data-lat=\"33.4650\" data-lng=\"126.9200\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">15:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🏖️ Beach</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Gwangchigi Beach</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Scenic east-coast beach with black lava rocks and Seongsan Ilchulbong as a backdrop. Great for swimming or just relaxing.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gwangchigi+Beach+Jeju\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gwangchigi Beach</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/광치기해변\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T16:30\" data-lat=\"33.4059540478567\" data-lng=\"126.25654873629324\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">☕ Cafe</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Umu Cafe</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Scenic cafe near Seongsan with ocean views. Great for afternoon coffee and views back to the volcanic peak.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/9rWsErEPUwd7wSPu9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Umu</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/우무+카페+성산\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T17:00\" data-lat=\"33.26235649570158\" data-lng=\"126.49473094088607\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">17:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍊 Cafe</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Gamttanam — Orange Cafe</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Famous orange/tangerine themed cafe in Jeju. The island is famous for hallabong citrus, and this cafe uses them in drinks and desserts.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/gwT68uXbakAW2xT88\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/감태나무+제주\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-01T19:30\" data-lat=\"33.49112408965034\" data-lng=\"126.50181770217206\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🐷 Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Jung Jong Jeju Black Pork BBQ (흑돼지)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Jeju's signature dish — black Berkshire pigs raised on the island, with distinctly richer flavour. Best enjoyed as thick slices of pork belly (samgyeopsal) grilled over charcoal.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Wo5RRJGezrjXzfdP9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/중정제주흑돼지\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Set alarm for 04:00</strong> — depart by 04:10 for the ~55 min drive to Seongsan. Aim to arrive 05:10–05:20, hike up in 20–30 min, and catch sunrise at 05:40–06:00. Cafes and restaurants near Seongsan open from ~08:00.</div>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false